      "created_at": "2014-02-10T05:16:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was playing a game today with Absolute Zero and Legacy.&nbsp; Legacy was giving his +1 to damage with Inspiring Presence.&nbsp; Absolute Zero had Null-Point Calibration Unit, Isothermic Transducer, Focused Apertures, and Thermal Shockwave in play.&nbsp; So, when Absolute Zero uses the Thermal Shockwave Power does the +1 from Legacy keep Cumulating?&nbsp;</p><p>For example, I targeted 3 villain targets and did 3 cold damage to each (1 from the power, +1 from Legacy, and +1 from Focused Apertures) and then I did 10 fire damage to myself because I did 9 damage total to the targets and then Legacy's +1 added 1 more again.&nbsp; Then after that Isothermic Transducer kicks in and I do 12 Cold damage (+1 from Legacy and +1 from Focused Apertures) to my final target.</p><p>Is this the correct way to play this?</p>",
